{
  "apiVersion": "dashboard.grafana.app/v1",
  "kind": "Dashboard",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "etcd-reference"
  },
  "spec": {
    "__inputs": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "description": "Prometheus datasource that scrapes etcd metrics",
        "type": "datasource",
        "pluginId": "prometheus",
        "pluginName": "Prometheus"
      }
    ],
    "annotations": {
      "list": []
    },
    "description": "Reference etcd health dashboard with panels adapted from the upstream etcd mixin. The mixin is not required to use this dashboard. Import it into Grafana with a Prometheus datasource that scrapes etcd. $cluster selects the Kubernetes cluster (k8s_cluster_name); $job selects the Prometheus etcd scrape job.",
    "editable": true,
    "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "id": null,
    "links": [
      {
        "asDropdown": false,
        "icon": "external link",
        "includeVars": false,
        "keepTime": false,
        "tags": [],
        "targetBlank": true,
        "title": "etcd mixin",
        "tooltip": "",
        "type": "link",
        "url": "https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/tree/main/contrib/mixin"
      }
    ],
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Requirements and scope",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 12,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "### Scope\nReference etcd health dashboard with panels adapted from the upstream etcd mixin. The mixin is a collection of reusable monitoring dashboard definitions, not a component this dashboard needs at runtime. You do not need to install it. Import this JSON and select a Prometheus datasource that scrapes etcd. Empty panels mean etcd is not scraped.\n\n### Source\nQueries and panel set were adapted from the [etcd mixin](https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/tree/main/contrib/mixin) (`contrib/mixin/dashboards/targets.libsonnet` and `panels.libsonnet`). Default mixin config (`config.libsonnet`) uses `etcd_selector: job=~\".*etcd.*\"` and `clusterLabel: job`. This dashboard splits those apart rather than calling a job a cluster: **`$cluster`** selects the Kubernetes cluster (`k8s_cluster_name`) and **`$job`** selects the Prometheus etcd scrape job.\n\n`$job` is populated from `etcd_server_has_leader`, so it only ever lists etcd jobs, and it replaces the `.*etcd.*` selector. That matters for **RPC rate**, **Active streams**, and **Memory**, whose series (`grpc_server_*`, `process_resident_memory_bytes`) are not etcd-specific \u2014 `$job` is what keeps the apiserver's gRPC and other processes' memory out of those panels. It is single-select for the same reason.\n\n### Mixin panels included\n- Up \u2014 `sum(etcd_server_has_leader{...})` (members with a leader, not scrape `up{}`)\n- RPC rate \u2014 unary `grpc_server_started_total` vs failed unary `grpc_server_handled_total`\n- Active streams \u2014 Watch and Lease bidi (`started \u2212 handled`)\n- DB size \u2014 allocated vs in-use bytes (fragmentation / defrag)\n- Disk sync duration \u2014 p99 WAL fsync and p99 backend commit\n- Memory \u2014 `process_resident_memory_bytes`\n- Client/peer traffic in/out\n- Total leader elections per day \u2014 `changes(etcd_server_leader_changes_seen_total[1d])`\n- Peer round trip time \u2014 p99\n\n### Metric dependencies\nThe mixin is not required. etcd metrics must be scraped by the selected Prometheus datasource.\n\n### Refresh\nAuto-refresh is `1m`, not the mixin's `10s`. Grafana rejects a dashboard whose refresh is below the server's `min_refresh_interval` with \"Dashboard refresh interval is too low\". Raise it further if your Grafana sets a higher minimum."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "stat",
        "title": "Up",
        "description": "Count of etcd members that currently have a leader (etcd_server_has_leader), not Prometheus scrape up{}.",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 7,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 12
        },
        "interval": "1m",
        "targets": [
          {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
            },
            "expr": "sum(etcd_server_has_leader{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",job=\"$job\"})",
            "legendFormat": "{{cluster}} - {{namespace}}",
            "refId": "A",
            "interval": "1m"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 3
                }
              ]
            },
            "noValue": "No scrape"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "none",
          "graphMode": "none",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "RPC rate",
        "description": "Unary gRPC RPC rate vs failed unary RPCs (Unknown, FailedPrecondition, ResourceExhausted, Internal, Unavailable, DataLoss, DeadlineExceeded).",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 7,
          "w": 10,
          "x": 6,
          "y": 12
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
            },
            "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_started_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",job=\"$job\",grpc_type=\"unary\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
            "legendFormat": "RPC rate",
            "refId": "A",
            "interval": "1m"
          },
          {
            "datasource": {
              "type": "prometheus",
              "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
            },
            "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_handled_total{k8s_cluster_name=~\"$cluster\",job=\"$job\",grpc_type=\"unary\",grpc_code=~\"Unknown|FailedPrecondition|ResourceExhausted|Internal|Unavailable|DataLoss|DeadlineExceeded\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
            "legendFormat": "RPC failed rate",
            "refId": "B",
            "interval": "1m"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "lineInterpolation": "linear",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "fillOpacity": 0,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "spanNulls": false,
              "stacking": {
                "group": "A",
                "mode": "none"
              }
            },
            "min": 0,
            "unit": "ops"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "displayMode": "list",
            "placement": "right",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "none"
          }
        },
        "interval": "1m"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Active streams",
        "description": "Watch and Lease bidi streams currently open (started minus handled).",
        "datasource": {
